    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were one of thousands of worker-class robots created to work in this mine. This was once your workplace. Later, it became the headquarters of a rebellion. Now, it is a desolate and dangerous graveyard abandoned after the war. Illuminate your path and escape. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this desolate mine, built in layers underground.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique 2D action-adventure experience awaits, with darkness in black and white.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 7549\u2019s agility to evade dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your greatest enemy is the darkness itself. Be careful not to lose your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront humans who seek to destroy you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t fall into traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your intelligence as a weapon, and don\u2019t let humans capture you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling parkours will be accompanied by challenging puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655100/extras/1e6dd5df35b4a3ade7abfa524c0ecbad.poster.avif?t=1751316199\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655100/extras/1e6dd5df35b4a3ade7abfa524c0ecbad.webm?t=1751316199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655100/extras/1e6dd5df35b4a3ade7abfa524c0ecbad.mp4?t=1751316199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were one of thousands of worker-class robots created to work in this mine. This was once your workplace. Later, it became the headquarters of a rebellion. Now, it is a desolate and dangerous graveyard abandoned after the war. Illuminate your path and escape. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this desolate mine, built in layers underground.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique 2D action-adventure experience awaits, with darkness in black and white.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 7549\u2019s agility to evade dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your greatest enemy is the darkness itself. Be careful not to lose your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront humans who seek to destroy you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t fall into traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your intelligence as a weapon, and don\u2019t let humans capture you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling parkours will be accompanied by challenging puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655100/extras/1e6dd5df35b4a3ade7abfa524c0ecbad.poster.avif?t=1751316199\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655100/extras/1e6dd5df35b4a3ade7abfa524c0ecbad.webm?t=1751316199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655100/extras/1e6dd5df35b4a3ade7abfa524c0ecbad.mp4?t=1751316199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
